{{ layout "layouts/site.vto" }}

{{ setMetadata('title', 'Privacy Policy') }}

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
  <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-sand-900 dark:text-white mb-8">
    Privacy Policy
  </h1>

  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <p>
      This page outlines the privacy policy for the Vitto website. We are committed
      to protecting your personal information and ensuring your experience on
      our site is safe and secure.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect personal information from visitors. This website is a static site
      and does not use cookies, analytics, or tracking technologies beyond what is provided
      by the hosting platform.
    </p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>
    <p>
      This site contains links to external services (GitHub, X/Twitter, Cloudflare).
      These services have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, please reach out via
      <a href="https://github.com/riipandi/vitto/issues">GitHub Issues</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
